<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to ShopEase</title>

    <style>
            * {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            body {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f2f8 0%, #e4e8f5 100%);
                font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
                color: #2d3748;
                padding: 40px 15px;
                min-height: 100vh;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .container {
                max-width: 600px;
                margin: auto;
                background: #ffffff;
                border-radius: 24px;
                overflow: hidden;
                box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(83, 74, 183, 0.12), 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
                transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            }

                .container:hover {
                    transform: translateY(-4px);
                }

            .header {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 50%, #6d28d9 100%);
                padding: 50px 30px 40px;
                text-align: center;
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
            }

                .header::before {
                    content: '';
                    position: absolute;
                    top: -50%;
                    right: -30%;
                    width: 80%;
                    height: 200%;
                    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
                    transform: rotate(25deg);
                    pointer-events: none;
                }

                .header::after {
                    content: '';
                    position: absolute;
                    bottom: 0;
                    left: 0;
                    right: 0;
                    height: 4px;
                    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fcd34d, #fbbf24, #fcd34d);
                    background-size: 200% 100%;
                    animation: shimmer 3s ease-in-out infinite;
                }

            @@keyframes shimmer {
                0%, 100% {
                    background-position: 0% 0%;
                }

                50% {
                    background-position: 100% 0%;
                }
            }

            .header h1 {
                color: #fff;
                font-size: 34px;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: -0.5px;
                position: relative;
                z-index: 1;
            }

                .header h1 .wave {
                    display: inline-block;
                    animation: wave 2s ease-in-out infinite;
                }

            @@keyframes wave {
                0%, 100% {
                    transform: rotate(0deg);
                }

                25% {
                    transform: rotate(20deg);
                }

                75% {
                    transform: rotate(-10deg);
                }
            }

            .header p {
                color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
                font-size: 17px;
                font-weight: 400;
                position: relative;
                z-index: 1;
                letter-spacing: 0.3px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 40px 45px 35px;
            }

                .content h2 {
                    color: #1a1a2e;
                    margin-bottom: 16px;
                    font-size: 24px;
                    font-weight: 700;
                    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
                }

                    .content h2 strong {
                        color: #4f46e5;
                    }

                .content p {
                    line-height: 1.8;
                    margin-bottom: 18px;
                    color: #4a5568;
                    font-size: 15px;
                }

                    .content p strong {
                        color: #4f46e5;
                    }

            .credentials {
                background: #f8f7ff;
                border: 2px solid #e8e5ff;
                border-radius: 16px;
                padding: 28px 30px;
                margin: 28px 0 32px;
                transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
            }

                .credentials:hover {
                    border-color: #a78bfa;
                }

                .credentials h3 {
                    margin-bottom: 20px;
                    color: #4f46e5;
                    font-size: 18px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
                    display: flex;
                    align-items: center;
                    gap: 10px;
                }

                    .credentials h3::before {
                        content: '🔐';
                        font-size: 20px;
                    }

            table {
                width: 100%;
                border-collapse: collapse;
            }

                table td {
                    padding: 14px 0;
                    border-bottom: 2px solid #edeafc;
                    font-size: 15px;
                }

                table tr:last-child td {
                    border-bottom: none;
                }

                table td:first-child {
                    font-weight: 600;
                    color: #1a1a2e;
                    width: 160px;
                }

            .password {
                font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
                background: #ede8ff;
                color: #4f46e5;
                padding: 6px 14px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                font-weight: 700;
                font-size: 14px;
                display: inline-block;
                letter-spacing: 0.5px;
                border: 1px solid #ddd6fe;
            }

            .email {
                color: #4f46e5;
                font-weight: 600;
            }

            .button-area {
                text-align: center;
                margin: 35px 0 30px;
            }

            .button {
                display: inline-block;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed);
                color: #ffffff !important;
                text-decoration: none;
                padding: 16px 48px;
                border-radius: 60px;
                font-weight: 600;
                font-size: 16px;
                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3);
                transition: all 0.3s ease;
                letter-spacing: 0.3px;
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
            }

                .button::after {
                    content: '→';
                    margin-left: 8px;
                    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
                    display: inline-block;
                }

                .button:hover {
                    transform: translateY(-3px);
                    box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
                }

                    .button:hover::after {
                        transform: translateX(6px);
                    }

                .button:active {
                    transform: translateY(0px);
                }

            .note {
                background: #fffbeb;
                border-left: 6px solid #f59e0b;
                padding: 20px 24px;
                border-radius: 12px;
                margin-top: 25px;
            }

                .note strong {
                    color: #92400e;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    display: block;
                    margin-bottom: 4px;
                }

                .note br {
                    display: none;
                }

                .note p {
                    margin-bottom: 0;
                    color: #78350f;
                }

            .footer {
                text-align: center;
                background: #faf9fe;
                padding: 28px 30px;
                border-top: 2px solid #f0edfc;
            }

                .footer p {
                    color: #94a3b8;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    line-height: 1.8;
                    margin: 0;
                }

                    .footer p:first-child {
                        font-weight: 500;
                        color: #6b7280;
                        margin-bottom: 2px;
                    }

            @@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
                body {
                    padding: 20px 12px;
                }

                .content {
                    padding: 28px 20px 25px;
                }

                .header {
                    padding: 38px 20px 32px;
                }

                    .header h1 {
                        font-size: 28px;
                    }

                    .header p {
                        font-size: 15px;
                    }

                table td:first-child {
                    width: 100px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                }

                table td {
                    font-size: 14px;
                    padding: 12px 0;
                }

                .credentials {
                    padding: 20px 18px;
                }

                    .credentials h3 {
                        font-size: 16px;
                    }

                .button {
                    padding: 14px 36px;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    width: 100%;
                    text-align: center;
                }

                .footer {
                    padding: 20px;
                }

                .note {
                    padding: 16px 18px;
                }
            }

            @@media only screen and (max-width: 400px) {
                table td:first-child {
                    width: 80px;
                }

                .password {
                    font-size: 12px;
                    padding: 4px 10px;
                }
            }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="header">
            <h1><span class="wave">🎉</span> Welcome to ShopEase</h1>
            <p>Your account has been created successfully.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">

            <h2>Hello <strong>{{Name}}</strong>,</h2>

            <p>
                Welcome to <strong>ShopEase</strong>! We're excited to have you with us.
                Your account is now ready, and you can sign in using the credentials below.
            </p>

            <div class="credentials">

                <h3>Account Information</h3>

                <table>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Email</td>
                        <td class="email">{{Email}}</td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td>Password</td>
                        <td>
                            <span class="password">{{Password}}</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

            </div>

            <div class="button-area">
                <a href="{{LoginUrl}}" class="button">
                    Login to ShopEase
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="note">
                <strong>🔒 Security Tip:</strong>
                <p>Please change your temporary password immediately after your first login to keep your account secure.</p>
            </div>

            <p style="margin-top:30px;">
                If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is always happy to help.
            </p>

            <p style="margin-top:8px;">
                Happy Shopping! ❤️<br>
                <strong style="color:#4f46e5;">Team ShopEase</strong>
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>
                © {{Year}} ShopEase. All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
            <p>
                This is an automated email. Please do not reply.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>